#
# This directory is populated at Docker build time by the rhsm-certs-extractor
# stage in Dockerfile.nico-pxe. It contains RHEL subscription certificates
# that mkosi injects into the build sandbox via SandboxTrees= so that
# Distribution=rhel profiles can reach RHEL subscription repositories
# (kernel-core, systemd-boot, etc.) during the image build.
#
# Contents at build time:
#   etc/rhsm/           - RHSM configuration
#   etc/pki/entitlement/ - subscription entitlement certificates
#
# Never commit actual RHSM certificates here. The directory exists in git only
# to anchor the SandboxTrees= path referenced in mkosi.conf profiles.
